    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "今日も色々やっちゃいました……。\r\nうぅぅぅ……はぁ～～～～。",
            "enText": "Another day full of mistakes… Urgh… <i>Siiiiigh.</i>",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 5204441700861280571,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "ドトウちゃんすごいすごーい！\r\nはーっていっぱい息が吐けるんだね！！",
            "enText": "Whoa, Doto, that was cool!\nYou're sooo good at breathing out!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3601258730824815797,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "た、ただのため息ですけど……。\r\nそれってすごいんでしょうかぁ？",
            "enText": "I-It was just a sigh… How could that\nbe anything amazing?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -1466003377139543357,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "『ハイカツリョー』って言うんでしょ！\r\n走るのに大事だって漫画にあったよ！",
            "enText": "But that means you've got good lung\ncuppa-city, right?! The manga I'm reading\nsays that's super important to running!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -1016718457743409066,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "そんな……ほら、普通ですよぉ。\r\nすぅーー……はぁ～～。",
            "enText": "That's not it… I'm just breathing\nnormally, see? <i>Inhale… Exhale…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -4435431414877523123,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "わたしも一緒にやるっ！\r\nすーはー、すーはー！",
            "enText": "I wanna try too! <i>Inhale… Exhale…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -1974302826480819351,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "すぅーーー……はぁ～～～。",
            "enText": "<i>Inhale… Exhale…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 486219145693770598,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "おおー！　なんかこうすると気持ちいーね！\r\nドトウちゃんやっぱりすごーい！！",
            "enText": "Whoooa! You know, this actually feels\nreally good! I can't believe you discovered\nsomething so cooool!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 8413565406736295624,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "え、えぇ……？　あ、でも確かに、\r\nちょっとすっきりした……ような……？",
            "enText": "Wh-What? Ah, you're right… I feel\na little more… relaxed?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -8081400137836748679,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "……えへへ。ウララさんは、\r\nほんとにいい子ですねぇ。",
            "enText": "Hehe… Urara, you really are\nsuch a sweetheart.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 6449780971616113423,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
